{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"环路空间"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"环路空间"},2],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>另见"},{"Local":{"url":"环路空间(代数几何)","text":"环路空间 (代数几何)"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>设 "},{"Local":{"url":"无穷范畴","text":"$\\infty$-范畴"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathcal C$ 有终对象 $*$. 对于"},{"Local":{"url":"带基点对象","text":"带基点对象"}},{"Plain":" $x\\colon *\\to X$, 定义其<strong>环路空间</strong> $\\Omega X = \\Omega (X,x)$ 是如下拉回,\n$$\r\n\\begin{array}\r\n    {ccc}\r\n    \\Omega (X,x) &amp; \\to &amp; * \\\\\r\n    \\downarrow &amp; &amp; \\downarrow \\\\\r\n    * &amp; \\to &amp; X.\r\n\\end{array}\r\n$$</p>\n<h2>性质</h2>\n<h3>群结构</h3>\n<p>环路空间 $\\Omega(X,x)$ 有"},{"Local":{"url":"群","text":"群"}},{"Plain":"结构. 该群结构关于 $x$ 有函子性, 也即有函子\n$$\r\nX \\to \\mathsf{Grp},\\,x\\mapsto\\Omega(X,x).\r\n$$\n见"},{"Local":{"url":"共轭作用","text":"共轭作用"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}